Following in the footsteps of a few hackers before (see
http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/browse_thread/thread/c1c1998fa28729f8/319e22471c16aeb3)
I have constructed a patch that reassigns the colours of monster
glyphs. The point of this patch is to reassign the colors such that
more monsters can be differentiated, and that more colors are assigned
consistently to monsters of a paticular type.

Verbose List of Changes That Are In The Patch Header But I Am Posting
Them Here Because Otherwise Nobody Will Read Them:

* Firstly, the following colours are declared:

HI_FIRE = red
HI_FROST = bright cyan
HI_ZAP = bright blue
HI_WATER = deep blue
HI_MINERAL = gray
HI_FOREST = green
HI_LORD = deep blue
HI_KING = magenta

