* The lycanthrope colours have been set thus:
- human werejackal = werejackal = jackal ( CLR_BROWN )
- human wererat = wererat = sewer rat ( CLR_BLACK )
- human werewolf = werewolf = wolf ( CLR_GRAY )

* The mercenary colours have been set thus:
- soldier = watchman ( CLR_GRAY )
- Kop Sergeant = sergeant ( CLR_CYAN )
- Kop Lieutenant = lieutenant = watch captain ( CLR_GREEN )
- Kop Kaptain = captain = orc-captain ( CLR_YELLOW )

* Under the principle of "growth stages are equal", the following
changes have been made:
- Cockatrice = chickatrice ( CLR_YELLOW )
- Giant rat = sewer rat ( CLR_BLACK )
- Giant bat = bat ( CLR_BROWN )
- Giant spider = cave spider ( HI_MINERAL )
- Manes = lemure ( CLR_BROWN )
This principle has been ignored in the case of mimics (for whose class
no other members exist) and "normal->lord->king" rank progression.

* The zombie/mummy races' colours have been set thus:
- Kobold zombie = kobold mummy = kobold ( CLR_ORANGE )
- Orc zombie = orc mummy = orc = hill orc ( CLR_GRAY )
- Gnome zombie = gnome mummy = gnome ( CLR_BROWN )
- Dwarf zombie = dwarf mummy = dwarf ( CLR_RED )
- Elf zombie = elf mummy = elf = Woodland-elf ( HI_FOREST )
- Human zombie = human mummy = human ( CLR_WHITE )
- Ettin zombie = ettin mummy = ettin ( CLR_BLUE )
- Giant zombie = giant mummy = giant = hill giant ( CLR_CYAN )

* Foxes are now orange, to differentiate from hell hounds.
* Wargs are now black, to differentiate from jackals.
* Mind flayers and master mind flayers are now bright magenta, to
differentiate from dwarf kings.
* Giant mimics and vorpal jabberwocks are now bright magenta (to
reserve magenta for kings.)
* Rabid rats are now red, to differentiate from woodchucks.
* Goblins are now green, to differentiate from hill orcs.
* Snakes have been set thus:
- Garter snakes are now yellow (to match real garter snakes)
- Snakes are now green.
- Pit vipers are now brown.
- Pythons are now red.
- Cobras are now black.
* Ki-rin are now orange, to differentiate from Aleaxes.
* Vampire bats are red, to match vampires.
* The major demons have been set thus:
- Barbed devils are now orange.
- Vrocks are now cyan.
- Hezrou are now yellow (they are toad-shaped demons.)
- Bone devils are now white (to match skeletons.)
- Balrogs are now black.
- Djinn are now the same colour as smoky potions (CLR_GRAY).
- Sandestins are now white.
- Death, Famine and Pestilence are now bright magenta (colour of
warning level 5)
* Clay golems are now orange (terracotta).
* Ghosts are now the same colour as milky potions (CLR_WHITE).
* Ninjas are now black.

